1. Axe'n'Stax (MIT licence), commit bdd4fe877acf3a6f4ca3174d1ce79c6672935e2f

   Patterns adapted (not copied verbatim) from the Axe'n'Stax engine:
   - boot stack: winit 0.30 ApplicationHandler with GPU created in `resumed`
     and dropped in `suspended`, android-activity NativeActivity entry
     (`android_main`), cdylib + rlib crate layout (src/app.rs, src/lib.rs);
   - wgpu device request with downlevel limits raised to the adapter's
     resolution (src/render/gpu.rs);
   - the wgpu 29 surface-acquire handling and the offscreen texture →
     buffer readback with 256-byte row alignment (src/app.rs,
     src/render/capture.rs);
   - egui-wgpu painting in a LoadOp::Load pass and headless egui frames
     (src/ui/painter.rs, src/engine.rs);
   - per-finger touch id tracking so lifting one finger never moves another
     (src/platform/input.rs).

